    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 488,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Morgause\nMorgause [ m\u0254r\u02c8\u0261e\u026az ] is a character in later Arthurian traditions , appearing in Thomas Malory 's 15th-century text Le Morte d'Arthur as the mother of Gawain and Mordred , both key players in the story of King Arthur and his downfall . Mordred is the offspring of Arthur 's inadvertent incest with Morgause , the king 's estranged half-sister . She is also a sister of Morgan le Fay and the wife of King Lot of Orkney , as well as the mother of Gareth , Agravain , and Gaheris ."
     }
    ],
    "status": "ok"
   },
